  title: "Catholic Renewal and the Wars of Religion",
  summary:
    "The Catholic answer—Ignatius and the Jesuits, the Council of Trent, Teresa of Ávila and the Baroque—and a century of religious war: St. Bartholomew's Day and the Edict of Nantes, the Dutch Revolt and the Armada, and the Thirty Years' War, ended at Westphalia.",
